 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Follow-up. The bowel thing."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Right, you've been on the fibre treatment for six weeks. How are things?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Bit better. Still up and down."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Describe up and down."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Constipated for three days, then loose. Then fine. Then again."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any pain?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Cramping. Lower left. Eases when I go."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any blood in the stool?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Weight loss?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No. Same."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any waking at night to open your bowels?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No. Sleep through."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Allergies?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "None."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Remind me, what are you taking?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Ispaghula husk. One sachet. Once a day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And your history?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Irritable bowel. Diagnosed last year. And hay fever."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you drink coffee, or alcohol?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Four coffees. Couple of beers weekends."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me check your tummy.",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Fine. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Soft, a bit of tenderness on the lower left, no masses, nothing worrying."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "So? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Alternating bowels with cramps that ease on opening them, normal tests so far, fits with irritable bowel. I'd call it irritable bowel syndrome with mixed bowel habit."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "What now? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Keep the husk going, with plenty of water. It takes at least twelve weeks to judge. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Right. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Cut the coffee to two a day, eat regularly, and try peppermint tea."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Peppermint. Fine. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And there's one blood test I'd like to check, a coeliac screen, as it can mimic this."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "If you notice blood, weight loss, or night-time diarrhoea, come back at once."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Will do. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Otherwise, I'll see you if it's not settling. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Thanks. ~"
  }
